    {
      "name": "int4-weight-moe-per-bucket-blockm-and-byte-once-dequant",
      "title": "Per-bucket BLOCK_M plus byte-once dual-nibble int4 dequant on weight-quantized MoE GEMM",
      "description": "Per-bucket BLOCK_M/num_warps plus byte-once dual-nibble int4 dequant lifts a weight-quantized MoE grouped GEMM ~4.6x, empirical roofline 0.10 to 0.60.",
      "keywords": [
        "moe",
